direction: down
title: "SAME COMMAND, INDEPENDENT TRACE RECORDS\nPublic-source construction; fixed direct-enter domain"
title.shape: text
register: "Public adds create separate records\nf list: A then B; both callbacks call f once\nNo cancellation, mutation, limits or extra traces"
a: "Outer f enters A\nA busy; I suppresses interpreter traces\nA calls f again"
b: "Nested direct scan on SAME f\nSkip busy A; idle B still enters\nB becomes busy and calls f"
both: "Deeper f skips A and B callback bodies\nBoth records busy; f body still runs\nReturn B, nested f, then A"
second: "Outer scan now reaches B\nA is idle again; B calls f\nNested A executes and calls f with both busy"
done: "Source-matched result for two records\n4 trace callback bodies; 5 f bodies\nMaximum 2 simultaneous trace callbacks"
boundary: "General fixed-r recurrence\nT(0)=0; T(k)=k*(1+T(k-1))\nChanging to name-wide suppression changes observations\nCounts derived by hand; no native run"
register -> a -> b -> both -> second -> done -> boundary
b.style.fill: "#DFEEFF"
done.style.fill: "#E8F4E8"
boundary.style.fill: "#FFF0E5"
